      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough veterinary and therapy specialists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the clinical expertise and warm dedication of Dr Dario, Dr Nichole, veterinary physiotherapist Issy, and receptionist Anna. Reviewers note that consultations are never rushed, with clinical options and scans explained thoroughly. Clients describe a compassionate, family-like clinic where surgeons and rehabilitation staff collaborate seamlessly under one roof."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful surgeries and post-operative rehab"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report exceptional medical outcomes for complex procedures, including emergency pelvic fracture treatments, knee operations, neutering, and ultrasound scans. Reviews frequently commend the integrated physiotherapy and hydrotherapy programmes for restoring mobility in dogs with arthritis or post-trauma injuries. Clients express deep relief seeing pets recover smoothly."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how patiently the veterinary surgeons handle timid rescue dogs and delicate young kittens on Belsize Road. Reviewers note that clinicians build trust gradually before starting examinations, ensuring pets feel secure during treatments. Pet parents appreciate that even animals with significant handling anxieties remain calm during clinic appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
